<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/cursor') %>
  <%- include('partials/nav') %>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="cs-hero cs-hero-archerfield">
    <div class="cs-hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="cs-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="cs-hero-content">
      <span class="cs-hero-eyebrow">Trial Project</span>
      <h1 class="cs-hero-title">Archerfield</h1>
      <p class="cs-hero-sub">Short-Form Estate Reels</p>
      <% var csDate = ''; %>
      <dl class="cs-meta">
        <% if (csDate) { %><div><dt>Date</dt><dd><%= csDate %></dd></div><% } %>
        <div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Creative direction, cinematography and editing.</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Archerfield Links -->
  <div class="cs-artist-links reveal">
    <span class="cs-artist-label">Follow Archerfield</span>
    <a href="https://www.archerfieldhouse.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cs-artist-link" aria-label="Website">
      <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
    </a>
    <a href="https://www.instagram.com/Archerfieldhouse/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cs-artist-link" aria-label="Instagram">
      <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"/></svg>
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Overview -->
  <section class="cs-content">
    <div class="cs-content-inner reveal">
      <div class="cs-content-left">
        <span class="cs-content-eyebrow">Overview</span>
        <h2 class="cs-content-heading">The<br>Project</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-content-right">
        <p>A paid trial for Archerfield, filming short-form reels across the estate over two days. The approach mixed run-and-gun DV directing with a more composed, cinematic style.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Exploratory Production -->
  <section class="cs-days">
    <div class="cs-days-header reveal">
      <span class="cs-content-eyebrow">The Process</span>
      <h2 class="cs-content-heading">The Exploratory<br>Production</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-days-grid">
      <div class="cs-day-card reveal">
        <span class="cs-day-number">Day 01</span>
        <h3 class="cs-day-title">The Boathouse</h3>
        <div class="cs-day-block">
          <span class="cs-day-label">Focus</span>
          <p>Group Activities &amp; Autumn/Winter Lifestyle</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-day-block">
          <span class="cs-day-label">Execution</span>
          <p>Run-and-gun DV directing focused on movement, natural texture, and seasonal atmosphere. Designed to test real-time creative direction while anchoring the visual narrative in Archerfield's coastal surroundings and outdoors-driven identity.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-day-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <span class="cs-day-number">Day 02</span>
        <h3 class="cs-day-title">Archerfield House</h3>
        <div class="cs-day-block">
          <span class="cs-day-label">Focus</span>
          <p>Luxury Celebrations &amp; Estate Heritage</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-day-block">
          <span class="cs-day-label">Execution</span>
          <p>Cinematic movement, high-end composition, and deliberate lighting choices crafted to highlight the grand scale, rich history, and prestige of milestone celebrations within the main house.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Showreel -->
  <section class="cs-days" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="cs-days-header cs-days-header-tight reveal">
      <span class="cs-content-eyebrow">Watch</span>
      <h2 class="cs-content-heading">The Showreel</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-showreel-wrap reveal">
      <div class="cs-showreel-row">
        <div class="cs-showreel-video">
          <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata">
            <source src="/videos/day1-archerfield-reel1-web.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          </video>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-showreel-video cs-showreel-video-center">
          <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata">
            <source src="/videos/day1-archerfield-reel2-web.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          </video>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-showreel-video">
          <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata">
            <source src="/videos/day2-archerfield-web.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          </video>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="story-quote" style="max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <p>"Positioning estate heritage and modern lifestyle through hands-on creative direction and dynamic DV directing."</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stills Gallery -->
  <section class="ft-gallery">
    <div class="ft-gallery-header reveal">
      <span class="ft-gallery-eyebrow">Gallery</span>
      <h2 class="ft-gallery-heading">Stills Gallery</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-stills-grid">
      <div class="cs-stills-item reveal"><img src="/images/archerfield office.jpg" alt="Archerfield: Office"></div>
      <div class="cs-stills-item reveal reveal-delay-1"><img src="/images/archerfield house window.jpg" alt="Archerfield: House Window"></div>
      <div class="cs-stills-item reveal reveal-delay-2"><img src="/images/archerfield golf.jpg" alt="Archerfield: Golf"></div>
      <div class="cs-stills-item reveal"><img src="/images/archerfield tennis.jpg" alt="Archerfield: Tennis"></div>
      <div class="cs-stills-item reveal reveal-delay-1"><img src="/images/archerfield paper.jpg" alt="Archerfield: Print Collateral"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Summary -->
  <section class="cs-content">
    <div class="cs-content-inner reveal">
      <div class="cs-content-left">
        <span class="cs-content-eyebrow">Summary</span>
        <h2 class="cs-content-heading">Closing<br>Thoughts</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-content-right">
        <p>We set out to explore how short-form, on-location video could carry an estate's heritage and its everyday lifestyle in the same frame.</p>
        <p>We shot across two days on site, at the Boathouse and in Archerfield House, testing a run-and-gun approach and a more composed one.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <%- include('partials/signup') %>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
